/**
 * @page implementation_principles Implementation Principles
 * @brief Design rules used by InsightPC.
 * @tableofcontents
 *
 * @section implementation_principles_diagram Data ownership
 *
 * @dot
 * digraph Principles {
 *   graph [rankdir=TB, bgcolor="transparent", splines=ortho];
 *   node [shape=box, style="rounded,filled", color="#86b7a4", fillcolor="#effaf5", fontname="Arial"];
 *   edge [color="#52616f", arrowsize=0.8];
 *   UI [label="JavaFX controls"];
 *   Builders [label="Tab builders"];
 *   Service [label="SystemInfoService"];
 *   OSHI [label="OSHI hardware and OS APIs"];
 *   Settings [label="AppSettings / I18N / AppTheme"];
 *   UI -> Builders;
 *   Builders -> Service;
 *   Service -> OSHI;
 *   UI -> Settings;
 * }
 * @enddot
 *
 * @section implementation_principles_rules Rules
 *
 * - Keep OSHI access behind com.tlcsdm.insightpc.service.SystemInfoService.
 * - Keep tab construction in com.tlcsdm.insightpc.controller.tab builders so the
 *   main controller only coordinates lifecycle events.
 * - Keep user-visible strings in resource bundles and access them through
 *   com.tlcsdm.insightpc.config.I18N.
 * - Keep theme and locale persistence in com.tlcsdm.insightpc.config.AppSettings.
 */
